# Keep build contexts small and free of local state (dependencies, builds, caches, secrets).
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
# Test code (Shopify simulator with a fixed test secret, e2e store helper) never ships (2A-11).
backend/tests
backend/demo
